```

## Swapping Models

The `ModelClient` uses OpenAI-compatible API, so any VLM server works:
- Change `--model` and `--base-url` CLI flags
- Or set `PHONE_AGENT_MODEL` and `PHONE_AGENT_BASE_URL` env vars
- Use `ModelConfig.extra_body` for provider-specific parameters
- The model MUST support at least one configured action output format (`do(...)` / `finish(...)`, JSON schema, or OpenAI-compatible tool calls)
- Prefer `output_mode="text_dsl"` for current AutoGLM prompt compatibility; use `json_schema`, `tool_calls`, or `auto` only with matching provider behavior and adapter coverage
- The model MUST support image input (vision-language model)
